WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,590
Pretty and charming

2
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:02,040
This is clearly the best in nature

3
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,080
Cut off the ruby

4
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,800
The largest Rosary gemstone on earth

5
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:05,800
Just over 130 carats

6
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:06,720
And this piece in my hand

7
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:08,640
Calculated by carat, it is over 2,500 carats.

8
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:09,680
This is Huo Zhenqi’s priceless treasure

9
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:12,320
Enough to buy a city and Hui Hui

10
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:16,230
Are you really the legendary treasure-hunting god Megumin?

11
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:17,670
I thought it was another big ruby.

12
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:19,520
It turns out that the stone was cut just now

13
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:20,880
A little green skin brought out

14
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:23,520
We don’t want to dig out the big wool that grows on the top of the mountain. It would be too laborious to transport it.

15
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,280
It violates the treasure inspection rules, but

16
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:27,600
This also proves that your little guy is really sensitive to atomic particles.

17
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:30,400
A veritable treasure hunter, Megumi

18
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,440
Look again

19
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:33,280
Are there any red treasures like this around here?

20
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:41,580
Found it

21
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:42,900
Actually there is

22
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:44,900
This pulse is so beautiful

23
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:47,580
It’s even more stunning than the ice-type Hong Cui that Boss Zhao stole the head from last time.

24
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:48,860
Natural rubies over 100 grams

25
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:49,940
It's a national treasure

26
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:51,420
The largest of these three weighs one pound

27
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:52,460
The small one also weighs 2300 grams
